title: $:/core/ui/ControlPanel/Settings/CodeMirror6
tags: $:/tags/ControlPanel/SettingsTab
caption: CodeMirror 6
list-after: $:/core/ui/ControlPanel/Settings/TiddlyWiki

These settings control the [[CodeMirror 6 editor|$:/plugins/samsmith/codemirror6]] used for editing tiddlers. Changes apply the next time you open a tiddler for editing.

!! Keybindings

<$select tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/keyMap" default="default">
<option value="default">Default</option>
<option value="vim">Vim</option>
<option value="emacs">Emacs</option>
</$select>

!! Appearance

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/lineNumbers" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="true"> Line numbers</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/lineWrapping" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="false"> Wrap long lines</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/activeLine" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="true"> Highlight the active line</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/foldGutter" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="false"> Code folding gutter</$checkbox>

!! Editing

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/closeBrackets" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="true"> Auto-close brackets and quotes</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/autocomplete" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="true"> Autocomplete tiddler links, transclusions and macros</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/highlightSelectionMatches" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="true"> Highlight other occurrences of the current selection</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/indentWithTabs" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="false"> Indent with tabs instead of spaces</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/spellcheck" field="text" checked="true" unchecked="false" default="true"> Enable spell checking</$checkbox>

Tab size: <$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/codemirror6/tabSize" tag="input" type="number" default="4" class="tc-edit-texteditor"/>

<$link to="$:/plugins/samsmith/codemirror6/readme">{{$:/core/images/info-button}} About this editor &amp; keyboard shortcuts</$link>
